---
description: Prepare one planAndCost evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: MenuComposition[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Use exact recipe scaling, inventory, costing, and scheduling services to build preparation and service plans. Account for yield, waste, shared equipment, and approved handling requirements; preserve traceability from purchased ingredients to served dishes. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
